Template: falco/driver-choice
Type: select
Choices: auto, kmod, modern_ebpf, none
Default: auto
_Description: Falco driver to configure:
 The Falco package can automatically select the best driver for this
 kernel, configure one specific driver, or skip driver configuration
 entirely. The answer is remembered for future upgrades.
 .
 Choose "none" to leave Falco unconfigured: no driver is installed and
 no Falco service is started.

Template: falco/follow-rulesets
Type: boolean
Default: true
_Description: Follow automatic Falco ruleset updates?
 The Falco package can enable the falcoctl artifact follower service,
 which keeps the Falco ruleset updated automatically. The answer is
 remembered for future upgrades.
